Name: FideltyFX Single Pass Downsampler
Short Name: ffx-spd
URL: https://github.com/GPUOpen-Effects/FidelityFX-SPD
Version: 2.0
Revision: 7c796c6d9fa6a9439e3610478148cfd742d97daf
Update Mechanism: Static.HardFork (https://crbug.com/576058959)
License: MIT
License File: src/LICENSE
Security Critical: No
Shipped: yes

Description:
A single-pass downsampler used to generate texture mipmaps.

Local Modifications:
None

Update instructions:
1. Change the commits in crowbar.txtpb and Version and Revision above,
   then run from this directory:
   crowbar build --no-dry-run ./
2. The Vulkan internal shaders include src/ffx_a.h and src/ffx_spd.h.
   Regenerate them from the ANGLE root:
   scripts/run_code_generation.py
   If the SPD callback API changed, adapt ../../GenerateMipmap.comp
   first.
